		{"id":"g-128","type":"group","label":"Growth","x":1060,"y":3822,"width":430,"height":466,"color":"#8a8a8a"},
		{"id":"t-1","type":"text","text":"# uteach: build spec\nMulti-tenant SaaS that runs learning centers (language schools & exam prep): students, groups, schedule, attendance, payments & debts, exam scores, teacher payroll; parents updated via **Telegram**.\n\n**🤖 Agents: start with [[Projects/uteach/spec/00 - README (start here)|00 - README]]**\nDetailed spec notes live in `./spec/` next to this canvas. This canvas is the map; the notes are the source of truth.\n\nFirst market: 🇺🇿 Uzbekistan (uz/ru, UZS, Click/Payme/Uzum). Code must stay country-agnostic.","x":0,"y":0,"width":960,"height":304,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"t-2","type":"text","text":"## Legend\n🟩 **MVP**: build first (M0–M7)\n🟨 **v2**: right after launch (M8–M13)\n⬜ **Later**: growth (M14–M18)\n\nGroups = modules · cards = features\n📄 card in each module = link to its full spec","x":1020,"y":0,"width":520,"height":304},
		{"id":"t-3","type":"text","text":"## Stack (fixed) · [[Projects/uteach/spec/01 - Tech stack & architecture|01]]\n• TypeScript, pnpm monorepo\n• **Next.js** (App Router, Server Actions) + Tailwind + shadcn/ui\n• **Supabase**: Postgres + RLS, Auth, Storage, pg_cron\n• Worker: **grammY** Telegram bot + outbox sender\n• next-intl (uz, ru, en) · zod · Vitest · Playwright\n• Hosting: ~€5 VPS (Docker) + Supabase free → Pro","x":1600,"y":0,"width":640,"height":304,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"t-4","type":"text","text":"## Non-negotiable rules · [[Projects/uteach/spec/04 - Cross-cutting rules|04]]\n• RLS on every table; tenant = `center_id` ([[Projects/uteach/spec/03 - Roles & permissions|03]])\n• Money = `bigint` minor units, never floats\n• Schedule logic in branch timezone\n• All UI text via i18n (uz/ru/en)\n• Payments & SMS behind adapters\n• Schema changes start in [[Projects/uteach/spec/02 - Data model|02 - Data model]]","x":2300,"y":0,"width":640,"height":304,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"t-6","type":"text","text":"### M0 · Foundation\nMonorepo, auth (phone+OTP), centers, branches, rooms, staff, RLS, i18n, CI","x":60,"y":494,"width":300,"height":148,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-7","type":"text","text":"### M1 · Academic core\nCourses, groups, schedule rules, lesson generation, students, enrollments, Excel import","x":410,"y":494,"width":300,"height":148,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-9","type":"text","text":"### M2 · Attendance\nTeacher mobile sheet, edit window, matrix, notifications enqueued","x":760,"y":494,"width":300,"height":148,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-11","type":"text","text":"### M3 · Billing\nProration, monthly charges, payments, receipts, debtors, balances","x":1110,"y":494,"width":300,"height":148,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-13","type":"text","text":"### M4 · Telegram & SMS\nBot linking & menu, outbox sender, Eskiz fallback, broadcasts, reminders","x":1460,"y":494,"width":300,"height":148,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-15","type":"text","text":"### M5 · Leads CRM\nBoard, follow-ups, trials, convert to student","x":1810,"y":494,"width":300,"height":148,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-17","type":"text","text":"### M6 · Exam scores\nIELTS/SAT presets, group entry, progress charts, targets","x":2160,"y":494,"width":300,"height":148,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-19","type":"text","text":"### M7 · Launch\nPlans & trial, super-admin, dashboards, audit, prod infra → 🚀","x":2510,"y":494,"width":300,"height":148,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-22","type":"text","text":"### M8 · Online payments\nPayme, Click, Uzum adapters, pay links & codes, refunds, promo codes","x":60,"y":762,"width":300,"height":148,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"t-24","type":"text","text":"### M9 · Mini App\nTelegram portal for students & parents","x":410,"y":762,"width":300,"height":148,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"t-26","type":"text","text":"### M10 · Payroll\nPay rules, monthly runs, teacher earnings","x":760,"y":762,"width":300,"height":148,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"t-28","type":"text","text":"### M11 · Finance\nAccounts, expenses, kassa closing, P&L","x":1110,"y":762,"width":300,"height":148,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"t-30","type":"text","text":"### M12 · Analytics\nMoney, churn, funnel, teachers, at-risk","x":1460,"y":762,"width":300,"height":148,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"t-32","type":"text","text":"### M13 · Leads v2 & packages\nLead capture endpoints, Meta ads, package billing","x":1810,"y":762,"width":300,"height":148,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"t-35","type":"text","text":"### M14 · Learning\nHomework, materials, monthly PDF reports","x":60,"y":1030,"width":300,"height":122,"color":"#8a8a8a"},
		{"id":"t-37","type":"text","text":"### M15 · Growth\nReferrals, campaigns, public center page","x":410,"y":1030,"width":300,"height":122,"color":"#8a8a8a"},
		{"id":"t-39","type":"text","text":"### M16 · API & webhooks\nPublic REST API, signed webhooks","x":760,"y":1030,"width":300,"height":122,"color":"#8a8a8a"},
		{"id":"t-41","type":"text","text":"### M17 · Mock engine + AI\nOnline mocks, AI writing/speaking feedback","x":1110,"y":1030,"width":300,"height":122,"color":"#8a8a8a"},
		{"id":"t-43","type":"text","text":"### M18 · Expansion\nKZ (Kaspi), WhatsApp, Stripe, white-label bot","x":1460,"y":1030,"width":300,"height":122,"color":"#8a8a8a"},
		{"id":"t-45","type":"text","text":"📄 Full build order with \"done when\" criteria:\n[[Projects/uteach/spec/30 - Build milestones|30 - Build milestones]]","x":30,"y":1242,"width":520,"height":122,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"t-48","type":"text","text":"📄 [[Projects/uteach/spec/10 - Platform & onboarding|Full spec: 10 - Platform & onboarding]]","x":610,"y":1664,"width":390,"height":122,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"t-49","type":"text","text":"**Phone + password auth**\nOTP via Eskiz SMS hook; invites by link","x":610,"y":1800,"width":390,"height":96,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-50","type":"text","text":"**Onboarding wizard**\nCenter → branch → rooms → course presets → import → staff","x":610,"y":1910,"width":390,"height":122,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-51","type":"text","text":"**Staff & permissions**\nowner / admin (+flags, branches) / teacher","x":610,"y":2046,"width":390,"height":122,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-52","type":"text","text":"**Excel import**\nStudents, groups, enrollments, opening balances","x":610,"y":2182,"width":390,"height":122,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-53","type":"text","text":"**Plans & trial**\n14-day trial, past_due → read_only, student limits","x":610,"y":2318,"width":390,"height":122,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-54","type":"text","text":"**Super-admin**\nCenters, plans, invoices, support view, system health","x":610,"y":2454,"width":390,"height":122,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-56","type":"text","text":"📄 [[Projects/uteach/spec/11 - Leads CRM|Full spec: 11 - Leads CRM]]","x":1080,"y":1664,"width":390,"height":96,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"t-57","type":"text","text":"**Pipeline board**\nnew → contacted → trial_scheduled → trial_done → won / lost","x":1080,"y":1774,"width":390,"height":122,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-58","type":"text","text":"**Lead detail & timeline**\nNotes, calls, follow-up tasks, duplicate check","x":1080,"y":1910,"width":390,"height":122,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-59","type":"text","text":"**Trial lessons**\nGuest on a real lesson's attendance sheet","x":1080,"y":2046,"width":390,"height":96,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-60","type":"text","text":"**Convert to student**\nCreates student + guardian + enrollment","x":1080,"y":2156,"width":390,"height":96,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-61","type":"text","text":"**Auto-capture**\nWeb form endpoint, bot enquiry, Meta lead ads, round-robin","x":1080,"y":2266,"width":390,"height":122,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"t-63","type":"text","text":"📄 [[Projects/uteach/spec/12 - Students & groups|Full spec: 12 - Students & groups]]","x":1550,"y":1664,"width":390,"height":122,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"t-64","type":"text","text":"**Students & guardians**\nProfiles, siblings share guardians, notes","x":1550,"y":1800,"width":390,"height":96,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-65","type":"text","text":"**Courses, levels, groups**\nTeacher, room, capacity, price, schedule rules","x":1550,"y":1910,"width":390,"height":122,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-66","type":"text","text":"**Enroll / freeze / transfer / end**\nEach recalculates the month's charge","x":1550,"y":2046,"width":390,"height":96,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-67","type":"text","text":"**Group page**\nRoster, lessons, attendance matrix, scores","x":1550,"y":2156,"width":390,"height":122,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-69","type":"text","text":"📄 [[Projects/uteach/spec/13 - Schedule|Full spec: 13 - Schedule]]","x":2020,"y":1664,"width":390,"height":96,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"t-70","type":"text","text":"**Lesson generation**\nRules → lessons 8 weeks ahead, idempotent, holidays skipped","x":2020,"y":1774,"width":390,"height":122,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-71","type":"text","text":"**Conflict detection**\nDB exclusion constraints on room & teacher","x":2020,"y":1910,"width":390,"height":122,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-72","type":"text","text":"**Timetable**\nWeek/day by room or teacher, drag to reschedule","x":2020,"y":2046,"width":390,"height":122,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-73","type":"text","text":"**Cancel / makeup / substitute**\nWith notifications","x":2020,"y":2182,"width":390,"height":96,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-75","type":"text","text":"📄 [[Projects/uteach/spec/14 - Attendance|Full spec: 14 - Attendance]]","x":1550,"y":2388,"width":390,"height":96,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"t-76","type":"text","text":"**Mobile attendance sheet**\nPresent / Late / Absent / Excused, All present","x":1550,"y":2498,"width":390,"height":122,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-77","type":"text","text":"**Edit window**\nTeachers 48 h; admins any time (audited)","x":1550,"y":2634,"width":390,"height":96,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-78","type":"text","text":"**Absence alerts**\nGuardian notified after 10 min, deduped","x":1550,"y":2744,"width":390,"height":96,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-79","type":"text","text":"**At-risk detection**\n3 absences in a row or < 60% in 30 days","x":1550,"y":2854,"width":390,"height":96,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"t-81","type":"text","text":"📄 [[Projects/uteach/spec/15 - Payments & debts|Full spec: 15 - Payments & debts]]","x":2020,"y":2388,"width":390,"height":96,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"t-82","type":"text","text":"**Monthly charges**\nProrated by lessons, discounts, rounding","x":2020,"y":2498,"width":390,"height":96,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-83","type":"text","text":"**Record payment + receipt**\nCash/card/transfer, receipt numbers, PDF","x":2020,"y":2608,"width":390,"height":96,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-84","type":"text","text":"**Balances & debtors**\nFIFO oldest due date, aging, reminders","x":2020,"y":2718,"width":390,"height":96,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-85","type":"text","text":"**Adjustments & voids**\nWaive month, opening balances, write-offs","x":2020,"y":2828,"width":390,"height":96,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-86","type":"text","text":"**Online payments**\nPayme JSON-RPC, Click Prepare/Complete, Uzum; pay links & codes","x":2020,"y":2938,"width":390,"height":122,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"t-87","type":"text","text":"**Refunds, promo codes, packages**\n","x":2020,"y":3074,"width":390,"height":96,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"t-89","type":"text","text":"📄 [[Projects/uteach/spec/16 - Exam prep & scores|Full spec: 16 - Exam prep & scores]]","x":1080,"y":2498,"width":390,"height":122,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"t-90","type":"text","text":"**Exam types**\nIELTS, SAT, CEFR, Milliy sertifikat presets + custom","x":1080,"y":2634,"width":390,"height":122,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-91","type":"text","text":"**Group score entry**\nKeyboard grid, IELTS band rounding","x":1080,"y":2770,"width":390,"height":96,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-92","type":"text","text":"**Progress & targets**\nChart vs target & exam date, score uplift","x":1080,"y":2880,"width":390,"height":96,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-93","type":"text","text":"**Online mock engine**\nAuto-graded L/R","x":1080,"y":2990,"width":390,"height":96,"color":"#8a8a8a"},
		{"id":"t-94","type":"text","text":"**AI writing/speaking feedback**\nTeacher reviews first","x":1080,"y":3100,"width":390,"height":96,"color":"#8a8a8a"},
		{"id":"t-96","type":"text","text":"📄 [[Projects/uteach/spec/17 - Telegram bot & notifications|Full spec: 17 - Telegram bot & notifications]]","x":610,"y":2686,"width":390,"height":122,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"t-97","type":"text","text":"**Bot linking**\nShare contact → linked to students/guardians/staff","x":610,"y":2822,"width":390,"height":122,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-98","type":"text","text":"**Bot menu**\nSchedule, attendance, payments, scores","x":610,"y":2958,"width":390,"height":96,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-99","type":"text","text":"**Outbox pipeline**\nTemplates uz/ru/en, quiet hours, retries, dedupe","x":610,"y":3068,"width":390,"height":122,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-100","type":"text","text":"**SMS fallback**\nEskiz adapter, approved templates","x":610,"y":3204,"width":390,"height":96,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-101","type":"text","text":"**Broadcasts**\nBy branch/group/course/debtors","x":610,"y":3314,"width":390,"height":96,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-102","type":"text","text":"**WhatsApp & email**\nAdapters for expansion","x":610,"y":3424,"width":390,"height":96,"color":"#8a8a8a"},
		{"id":"t-104","type":"text","text":"📄 [[Projects/uteach/spec/18 - Teacher payroll|Full spec: 18 - Teacher payroll]]","x":1550,"y":3060,"width":390,"height":96,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"t-105","type":"text","text":"**Pay rules**\nFixed, per lesson, per student, % of payments/charges","x":1550,"y":3170,"width":390,"height":122,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"t-106","type":"text","text":"**Monthly runs**\nDraft → approved → paid (creates expenses)","x":1550,"y":3306,"width":390,"height":122,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"t-107","type":"text","text":"**My earnings**\nTeacher sees own breakdown","x":1550,"y":3442,"width":390,"height":96,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"t-109","type":"text","text":"📄 [[Projects/uteach/spec/19 - Finance & expenses|Full spec: 19 - Finance & expenses]]","x":2020,"y":3280,"width":390,"height":122,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"t-110","type":"text","text":"**Accounts**\nCash per branch, terminal, bank, online","x":2020,"y":3416,"width":390,"height":96,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"t-111","type":"text","text":"**Expenses & transfers**\nCategories, attachments","x":2020,"y":3526,"width":390,"height":96,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"t-112","type":"text","text":"**Kassa closing & P&L**\nDaily cash count, profit per branch","x":2020,"y":3636,"width":390,"height":96,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"t-114","type":"text","text":"📄 [[Projects/uteach/spec/20 - Analytics|Full spec: 20 - Analytics]]","x":1080,"y":3306,"width":390,"height":96,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"t-115","type":"text","text":"**Role dashboards**\nToday, money, students, follow-ups","x":1080,"y":3416,"width":390,"height":96,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-116","type":"text","text":"**Money / students / sales**\nCollection rate, churn, funnel by source","x":1080,"y":3526,"width":390,"height":96,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"t-117","type":"text","text":"**Teachers & attendance**\nRetention, score uplift, heatmap","x":1080,"y":3636,"width":390,"height":96,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"t-119","type":"text","text":"📄 [[Projects/uteach/spec/21 - Student & parent portal|Full spec: 21 - Student & parent portal]]","x":610,"y":3630,"width":390,"height":122,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"t-120","type":"text","text":"**Telegram Mini App**\ninitData-verified, per-student scope","x":610,"y":3766,"width":390,"height":96,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"t-121","type":"text","text":"**Pay in app**\nOpens Payme/Click link","x":610,"y":3876,"width":390,"height":96,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"t-122","type":"text","text":"**Native app**\nOnly if Telegram isn't enough","x":610,"y":3986,"width":390,"height":96,"color":"#8a8a8a"},
		{"id":"t-124","type":"text","text":"📄 [[Projects/uteach/spec/22 - Learning|Full spec: 22 - Learning]]","x":1550,"y":3648,"width":390,"height":96,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"t-125","type":"text","text":"**Homework**\nAssign, submit (incl. audio), score","x":1550,"y":3758,"width":390,"height":96,"color":"#8a8a8a"},
		{"id":"t-126","type":"text","text":"**Materials**\nPer course/level/group","x":1550,"y":3868,"width":390,"height":96,"color":"#8a8a8a"},
		{"id":"t-127","type":"text","text":"**Monthly PDF reports**\nSent to parents","x":1550,"y":3978,"width":390,"height":96,"color":"#8a8a8a"},
		{"id":"t-129","type":"text","text":"📄 [[Projects/uteach/spec/23 - Growth|Full spec: 23 - Growth]]","x":1080,"y":3842,"width":390,"height":96,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"t-130","type":"text","text":"**Referrals**\nCodes, auto rewards, anti-abuse","x":1080,"y":3952,"width":390,"height":96,"color":"#8a8a8a"},
		{"id":"t-131","type":"text","text":"**Campaigns & public page**\nSaved audiences, trial sign-up form","x":1080,"y":4062,"width":390,"height":96,"color":"#8a8a8a"},
		{"id":"t-132","type":"text","text":"**API & webhooks**\nScoped keys, signed deliveries","x":1080,"y":4172,"width":390,"height":96,"color":"#8a8a8a"},
		{"id":"t-134","type":"text","text":"### 🛠 Super-admin\nuteach team. Centers, plans, invoices, read-only support view (audited)","x":20,"y":1644,"width":380,"height":122,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"t-135","type":"text","text":"### 👔 Owner\nWhole center, all branches, all modules, settings, uteach billing","x":20,"y":1806,"width":380,"height":122,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"t-136","type":"text","text":"### 🗂 Admin\nReceptionist / branch manager. Branch-scoped; extra rights via permission flags","x":20,"y":1968,"width":380,"height":122,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"t-137","type":"text","text":"### 👩‍🏫 Teacher\nOwn groups only. Attendance, scores, topics, own earnings. Never sees money","x":20,"y":2130,"width":380,"height":122,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"t-138","type":"text","text":"### 🎓 Student · 👪 Parent\nNo password. Telegram bot + Mini App, identified by shared phone contact","x":20,"y":2292,"width":380,"height":122,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"t-139","type":"text","text":"📄 Permission matrix & RLS:\n[[Projects/uteach/spec/03 - Roles & permissions|03 - Roles & permissions]]","x":20,"y":2454,"width":380,"height":122,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"t-153","type":"text","text":"**Staff web app**\nOwner & admin (desktop), teacher pages (mobile)","x":2590,"y":1644,"width":290,"height":122},
		{"id":"t-154","type":"text","text":"**Telegram bot**\nStudents, parents, staff alerts","x":2905,"y":1644,"width":290,"height":122},
		{"id":"t-155","type":"text","text":"**Telegram Mini App** 🟨\n`/tg` portal","x":3220,"y":1644,"width":290,"height":96},
		{"id":"t-156","type":"text","text":"### Next.js app (`apps/web`)\nServer Components + Server Actions (user session → RLS)\n`/tg/api` Mini App API · `/api/pay/*` provider callbacks","x":2590,"y":1846,"width":450,"height":174,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"t-157","type":"text","text":"### Worker (`apps/worker`)\ngrammY bot (long polling)\nOutbox sender every 5 s (SKIP LOCKED)\nHeartbeat","x":3060,"y":1846,"width":450,"height":148,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"t-158","type":"text","text":"### Supabase\nPostgres (RLS on every table) · Auth · Storage · Vault\n**pg_cron**: lessons, monthly charges, reminders, analytics refresh","x":2590,"y":2100,"width":920,"height":122,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"t-159","type":"text","text":"**Payment providers** 🟨\nPayme · Click · Uzum (center's own merchant)","x":2590,"y":2302,"width":290,"height":122},
		{"id":"t-160","type":"text","text":"**Telegram Bot API**","x":2905,"y":2302,"width":290,"height":70},
		{"id":"t-161","type":"text","text":"**Eskiz.uz SMS**\nfallback + auth OTP","x":3220,"y":2302,"width":290,"height":96},
		{"id":"t-162","type":"text","text":"### Hosting (cheap launch)\nVPS ~€5/mo: Docker Compose `web` + `worker` + `caddy`\nSupabase free → **Pro $25 before first paying center**\nNo Vercel Hobby (non-commercial)","x":2590,"y":2484,"width":450,"height":200},
		{"id":"t-163","type":"text","text":"### Scheduled jobs\n`generate_lessons` daily · `generate_monthly_charges` 1st · `enqueue_payment_reminders` daily · `refresh_analytics` nightly. All idempotent.","x":3060,"y":2484,"width":450,"height":148},
