		{"id":"t-199","type":"text","text":"📄 Every column, enum, constraint & RLS rule: [[Projects/uteach/spec/02 - Data model|02 - Data model]]\nConventions: `id uuid`, `center_id` on every tenant row, money `*_amount bigint` (tiyin), soft delete `archived_at`, phones E.164.","x":30,"y":5368,"width":2200,"height":96,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"t-201","type":"text","text":"### 1 · Lead comes in\nInstagram, Telegram, walk-in, call, referral\n\n*Leads CRM*","x":30,"y":5764,"width":300,"height":230,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-202","type":"text","text":"### 2 · Contacted\nGoal (e.g. IELTS 7.0), level, schedule\n\n*Leads CRM*","x":400,"y":5764,"width":300,"height":230,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-203","type":"text","text":"### 3 · Trial lesson\nGuest on a real lesson's attendance sheet\n\n*Leads CRM · Schedule*","x":770,"y":5764,"width":300,"height":230,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-204","type":"text","text":"### 4 · Enrolled\nStudent + guardian + enrollment, prorated charge\n\n*Students & groups · Payments*","x":1140,"y":5764,"width":300,"height":230,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-205","type":"text","text":"### 5 · Attends\nTeacher marks; parent alerted on absence\n\n*Attendance · Telegram*","x":1510,"y":5764,"width":300,"height":230,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-206","type":"text","text":"### 6 · Pays monthly\nCharge on the 1st, reminders, receipt\n\n*Payments & debts*","x":1880,"y":5764,"width":300,"height":230,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-207","type":"text","text":"### 7 · Mock tests\nScores vs target, parents see progress\n\n*Exam prep & scores*","x":2250,"y":5764,"width":300,"height":230,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-208","type":"text","text":"### 8 · Renews / sits exam\nNext level or official result recorded\n\n*Students & groups · Exams*","x":2620,"y":5764,"width":300,"height":230,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-209","type":"text","text":"### 9 · Refers a friend\nReferral code → new lead\n\n*Growth ⬜*","x":2990,"y":5764,"width":300,"height":230,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"t-219","type":"text","text":"### ✖ Lost lead\nReason required → re-engage campaign later","x":400,"y":6194,"width":300,"height":170,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"t-220","type":"text","text":"### ⚠ Overdue debt\nReminders every N days → debtors list → call","x":1880,"y":6194,"width":300,"height":170,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"t-221","type":"text","text":"### ⚠ At-risk 🟨\n3 absences in a row / < 60% attendance → admin calls","x":2250,"y":6414,"width":300,"height":170,"color":"1"}
